{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray","id":1432904,"title":"Rule question - Pepper-spray","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-21T05:38:47-08:00","id":1432904,"title":"Rule question - Pepper-spray","content":"How would you design a pepper-spray, what weapon tags would you give it?<br /> A couple of years ago I made an armory document for Scion 1e.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I wanted to do something simular for my Scion 2e game, this time around my players are into cards, so I made weapon cards.<br /> But I'm uncertain about a pepper-spray.<br /> I'm thinking it's a melee weapon, with reach, but it could also be a Ranged weapon, with a short range tag.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqeo7c4v/Weapon%20-%20Pepper-spray.png?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqeo7c4v/Weapon%20-%20Pepper-spray.png?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqeo7c4v/Weapon%20-%20Pepper-spray.png?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqeo7c4v/Weapon%20-%20Pepper-spray.png?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T06:16:04-08:00","id":1432905,"title":"","content":"I'd say it's Concealable, Ranged, Stun, Firearm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T11:11:23-08:00","id":1432928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kalle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray#post1432904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wanted to do something simular for my Scion 2e game, this time around my players are into cards, so I made weapon cards.<br /> But I'm uncertain about a pepper-spray.<br /> I'm thinking it's a melee weapon, with reach, but it could also be a Ranged weapon, with a short range tag.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqeo7c4v/Weapon%20-%20Pepper-spray.png?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/kzya7kfoqe...spray.png?dl=0</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Are those weapon cards something you'd like to share? The one for pepper spray looks really nice!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T20:15:15-08:00","id":1433003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray?p=1432905#post1432905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say it's Concealable, Ranged, Stun, Firearm.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You'll need to come up with an effect for the Stun Tag since the one in Origin is from an earlier draft of the damage rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T00:55:04-08:00","id":1433020,"title":"","content":"I think a pepper spray needs a shorter range, then the normal Ranged tag.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aristarkos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray?p=1432928#post1432928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are those weapon cards something you'd like to share? The one for pepper spray looks really nice!</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, I can share them when I'm done.<br /> I also did cards for all the Knacks, Boons, Innate powers, Pantheons, Paths and a bunch of conditions, but most are made with text from the books, so Onyx path may not allow me to share them.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>literatzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray?p=1433003#post1433003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You'll need to come up with an effect for the Stun Tag since the one in Origin is from an earlier draft of the damage rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Literatzi, you are right, I didn't notice. I think I'm going to use the Stun Tag from Trinity, I think that would make sense.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T05:12:52-08:00","id":1433041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kalle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432904-rule-question-pepper-spray?p=1433020#post1433020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think a pepper spray needs a shorter range, then the normal Ranged tag.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I skimmed it and thought it went out to Short, but it's Medium instead. However, there doesn't seem to be a tag to give out to Short. I'd make a custom tag which goes out to Short but doesn't impose the 1 Difficulty penalty at Close that Ranged does.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T08:20:31-08:00","id":1433054,"title":"","content":"Medium range is around 100 meters (300 feet), Short range is about 10 meters (30 feet), I am quite sure it\u2019s not the case for a pepper spray.<br /> <br /> My experience is that the usual pepper spray is close range (about arm reach plus a little more), even the big cans that some police forces use can\u2019t spray more than 2 or 3 meters away effectively.<br /> <br /> I would make it cause Blinded condition as a 2 success Stunt (safety glasses and closed helmet would make it cost more, 2 more for glasses and 4 more for helmets). It may cause stun too if used in a target with a previous injury or with too little clothes covering the body (it causes pain in skin contact even if not hitting the eye, and it is worse if hit a bruise)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T10:41:35-08:00","id":1473906,"title":"","content":"It has been a while since I finished the cards, but I only used them with my own group and they were not really set up for publishing.<br /> But now I finished them up and put them on Drive though RPG.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/384614/Scion-Armory-Cards?src=by_author_of_product\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Armory Cards - Onyx Path Publishing | StoryPath Nexus | DriveThruRPG.com</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}